layers can afford to maintain a helicopter.<br></li><li> The large open world of 9 square kilometres will be fully accessible, but not every region is safe to be in.<br></li><li> Dynamic change of time of day</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong> A dynamic shooter with elements of RPG, survival, and management.</strong><br><strong>Anarchy: Wolf's Law \u2013 Action, fun, and total control! Capture territories, grow your business, and spread chaos throughout the world of Anarchy. Strengthen your grip on the regions, develop and establish production, crushing all those who stand in your way.</strong><br><br><strong>Capturing territories</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592680/extras/Angar_optimize.gif?t=1745030125\" /></div><br><br><strong>Production management</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592680/extras/98f76c06cd5d04f607020b4789282545.poster.avif?t=1745030125\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592680/extras/98f76c06cd5d04f607020b4789282545.webm?t=1745030125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592680/extras/98f76c06cd5d04f607020b4789282545.mp4?t=1745030125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dangerous night creatures</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592680/extras/e12afc71c69cec30bb4488e931329b4b.poster.avif?t=1745030125\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592680/extras/e12afc71c69cec30bb4488e931329b4b.webm?t=1745030125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592680/extras/e12afc71c69cec30bb4488e931329b4b.mp4?t=1745030125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Cars and racing</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_im